This project is a fork of https://github.com/neuspaces/terraform-provider-system,
forked at tag v0.5.0 (commit bf40626e, 2024-05-31) with the full upstream history
retained. The original work and this fork are licensed under the Mozilla Public
License, version 2.0; see LICENSE.

Changes made in this fork are recorded in CHANGELOG.md and in the git history.
The provider is published to the Terraform Registry and the OpenTofu Registry
under the address dorokhovich-com/system and keeps the resource, data source and
attribute names of upstream so that users of neuspaces/system can migrate with
`terraform state replace-provider`; see docs/guides/migration-from-neuspaces.md.

Contributions ported from upstream pull requests:
- `overwrite` for system_file and system_folder: PR #11 by raynigon
- `create_home` for system_user: PR #10 by ii1818nn (issue #9)
